WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:06.190
This query uses correlation to calculate a
test-specific benchmark For

00:00:06.217 --> 00:00:12.403
a Glucose row the inner query calculates the average
Glucose result For

00:00:12.417 --> 00:00:18.208
a Cholesterol row it calculates the average
Cholesterol result The

00:00:18.235 --> 00:00:23.861
outer test name changes the inner query This is a
powerful pattern

00:00:23.887 --> 00:00:26.492
when one global benchmark would not be meaningful
